    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 18th century America, the fires of the American Revolution have erupted. Brother has taken up arms against brother. But in this chaos, a crafty and pragmatic smuggler could make his fortune - and perhaps, even fall in love with a state!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a trade ship and run cargo from Quebec City to Spanish Louisiana, buying low and selling high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market prices will change dramatically each day - sometimes muskets will double in price, and sometimes rum will crash to half its value!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date one of the many Colonial-era state-chans, from Spanish-controlled Louisiana to Quebec!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate between Patriot minutemen, Loyalist militias, German Hessian mercenaries, native tribes, Spain, France, and pirates. Choose to align yourself with either the Revolutionaries or the British Empire and help tilt the war in their favor in regional questlines!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 18th century America, the fires of the American Revolution have erupted. Brother has taken up arms against brother. But in this chaos, a crafty and pragmatic smuggler could make his fortune - and perhaps, even fall in love with a state!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a trade ship and run cargo from Quebec City to Spanish Louisiana, buying low and selling high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market prices will change dramatically each day - sometimes muskets will double in price, and sometimes rum will crash to half its value!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date one of the many Colonial-era state-chans, from Spanish-controlled Louisiana to Quebec!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate between Patriot minutemen, Loyalist militias, German Hessian mercenaries, native tribes, Spain, France, and pirates. Choose to align yourself with either the Revolutionaries or the British Empire and help tilt the war in their favor in regional questlines!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Trade cargo during the American Revolution. Smuggle weapons and deliver secret packages for either the Patriots or the United Empire Loyalists. Date a state-chan!",
